  "figshare_url": "https://acs.figshare.com/articles/journal_contribution/Photoreactive_Carboxybetaine_Copolymers_Impart_Biocompatibility_and_Inhibit_Plasticizer_Leaching_on_Polyvinyl_Chloride/12906763",
